      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients appreciate that veterinarians examine pets with genuine patience and affection, offering treats and calming reassurance to reduce clinical anxiety. Pet parents highlight that nervous kittens and senior dogs feel safe and cared for throughout routine booster shots and checkups."
      }
    },
